# Line endings for the files that kept flip-flopping.
#
# The translation files are rewritten wholesale by anything that touches them:
# `flutter gen-l10n`, a JSON round-trip, a shell heredoc. Each tool picks its
# own line ending, and with no rule here the result was a 5,800-line diff every
# time one string changed -- which is exactly how an unrelated feature and a
# whole-file reformat once rode into a commit meant to change three cards.
#
# Pinned to what they are currently committed as, so this adds no churn of its
# own. The rest of the repository is deliberately left alone: it is a mix of
# both endings, and normalising all of it is a bigger decision than this file
# is trying to make.
*.arb text eol=lf
